// How the region's tiles are baked into navigation grids (content kind `nav`, id `default`):
// half-meter cells for the skeletons' body (`agent`), and once more for the warden's (the body
// class `large`: 0.8 m wide, 3.2 m tall). The bake files are in `assets/nav/` (the class's in
// `assets/nav/large/`); after editing a tile, its level file or the locomotion of either
// body, bake again (every class at once):
//
//   cargo sandbox --bake-nav            (or the dev tool `nav_bake`)
//
// `content check` names a missing or stale bake, per class. An NPC routes on the tightest
// class its body fits: skeletons on `agent`, the warden on `large`.
{
    "default": (cell: 0.5, agent: Some("skeleton"), safe_drop: 2.0, bodies: {"large": (locomotion: Some("warden"))}),
}
